---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Van tools and calculators" description="Free calculators for van buyers: electric vs diesel running costs and true lease cost.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Tools</h1>
    <p class="lede">Quick calculators to check the numbers before you sign anything.</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <a class="card" href="/tools/van-check/"><h3>Free van check</h3><p>MOT history, mileage record, repeat advisories, tax and recalls for any UK van.</p></a>
      <a class="card" href="/reliability/"><h3>Most reliable vans</h3><p>MOT failure rates by model and age from official DVSA data.</p></a>
      <a class="card" href="/tools/electric-vs-diesel/"><h3>Electric vs diesel cost</h3><p>Yearly running cost of an electric van against diesel, based on how and where you charge.</p></a>
      <a class="card" href="/tools/lease-true-cost/"><h3>Lease true-cost calculator</h3><p>Turn any lease quote into a real monthly cost so you can compare deals fairly.</p></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
